---
layout: base.njk
title: "Case studies | Synergy Solutions"
description: "Real engagements: how Synergy Solutions aligns leadership with strategy through keynotes, workshops, and executive programs."
permalink: "/case-studies/index.html"
---

<section class="case-studies-index-hero" aria-labelledby="case-studies-heading">
    <div class="case-studies-index-hero__inner">
        <h1 id="case-studies-heading" class="case-studies-index-hero__title">Case studies</h1>
        <p class="case-studies-index-hero__lede">
            Outcomes from engagements where leadership, culture, and execution had to move together — told with the metrics and narrative executives expect.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="case-studies-index-list">
    {% if collections.caseStudies | length %}
        <ul class="case-studies-cards">
            {% for study in collections.caseStudies %}
                <li class="case-studies-cards__item">
                    <article class="case-study-card">
                        <h2 class="case-study-card__title">
                            <a href="{{ study.url }}" class="case-study-card__link">{{ study.data.title }}</a>
                        </h2>
                        {% if study.data.subtitle %}
                            <p class="case-study-card__subtitle">{{ study.data.subtitle }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if study.data.client %}
                            <p class="case-study-card__meta">{{ study.data.client }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                        <a href="{{ study.url }}" class="case-study-card__cta">Read the study</a>
                    </article>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    {% else %}
        <p class="case-studies-index-empty">Case studies will appear here as they are published.</p>
    {% endif %}
</div>
